        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"thumbs up\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44d\" role=\"img\" title=\"thumbs up\">:thumbs_up:</span> cfallin submitted <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14607#pullrequestreview-5509030171\">PR review</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Looks good, thanks! Just a comment on the test style but the actual change LGTM. (Thanks for the patience and care in running benchmarks on this one too.)</p>\n</blockquote>",
