        "timestamp": 1791920735
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> cfallin created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14607#discussion_r4263219367\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Let's make this a <code>precise-output</code> test so that we can easily re-bless when we make global changes (e.g. anything that shifts regalloc results). You can add <code>precise-output</code> at the end of this <code>test</code> line (See other filetests here) and then <code>CRANELIFT_TEST_BLESS=1 cargo test -p cranelift-tools --test filetests</code> to update the file with a captured output snapshot.</p>\n</blockquote>",
